.demo-docker-build/

# Terraform working directories
**/.terraform/

# Terraform state files
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*

# Crash logs
**/crash.log

# Variable files (often contain secrets)
**/*.tfvars
**/*.tfvars.json

# Terraform plan files
**/*.tfplan
**/*.plan

# Terraform override files
**/override.tf
**/override.tf.json
**/*_override.tf
**/*_override.tf.json
